B.cMe=new A.G("church","Deep riddle #948 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.cCy=new A.G("church","[Set 31] Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.cHM=new A.G("church","Challenge 950: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.cM5=new A.G("logic","Deep riddle #951 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I?","A hole")
